@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Historical / alternative. Dated observation or rejected/unselected alternative is preserved without becoming a current MVP topology.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HISTORICAL / UNSELECTED — CP — documented artifact relationships
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Primary scope / requirements / dictionary / decisions\nExisting source authority and accepted bounded core" as Source
rectangle "Populated working models and recorded checks\nSource links / local identities / diagrams / artifact evidence" as Model
rectangle "Identified conditional handoff candidate\n04 function gap and exact semantic/dependency limits retained" as Handoff #DFF1EA
Source --> Model : documentary provenance
Model --> Handoff : inspectable package relationship
note bottom of Handoff
These artifacts exist; no minute-by-minute task timeline is reconstructed.
A prescribed working method or local PBI date is not actual Sprint execution.
No elapsed delay or performance gain follows from artifact counts.
end note

legend bottom
Source-based analysis; target behavior and hypotheses are not observed current task sequences.
No interview, business-task timing, live product/reference inspection or improvement test performed.
endlegend
@enduml
